{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59fazawcc1s","type":"work","title":"書目答問補正","authors":[{"name":"張之洞","role":"撰","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bcpi"},{"name":"范希曾","role":"補正","dynasty":"民國","entity_id":"hixhl5agxo1s"}],"juan_count":{"number":5},"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":5}],"measure_info":"五卷","description":{"text":"范希曾（1899—1930），字耒研，號穉露，江蘇淮陰人，近代目錄學家，師從柳詒徵。《書目答問補正》五卷，於張之洞《書目答問》（`d59f2nfowtfm`）原書體例基礎上，訂正原書著錄之作者姓名、版本訛誤，補入光緒元年（1874）以後之新版本，並增補與原書性質相近之書一千二百餘種。民國二十年（1931）南京國學圖書館初刻，1963年中華書局據以影印，是《書目答問》流傳最廣、學界最常徵引之校訂增補本。","sources":["WebSearch 覆核，2026-08-31"]},"resources":[{"name":"维基文库","type":"text","id":"wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9B%B8%E7%9B%AE%E7%AD%94%E5%95%8F"},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SSID-13358353_%E6%9B%B8%E7%9B%AE%E7%AD%94%E5%95%8F%E8%A3%9C%E6%AD%A3_%E5%8D%B71-2.pdf"}],"related_works":[{"id":"d59f2nfowtfm","title":"書目答問","relation":"studies"}],"contained_in":[{"id":"8rld0ts2thj4","volume_index":""}],"updated_at":"2026-08-31T00:00:00+00:00","period":"modern","period_basis":"補正者范希曾主要活動在民國間（成書1931年）","revision":"1.0.2","revised_at":"2026-09-07","books":["1zyu8qky36"],"has_text":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/c/1/s/d59fazawcc1s-書目答問補正.json","_isDraft":false}